.nh
.TH regi 8

.SH NAME
.PP
regi - Package manager and validator for declarative entity catalogs


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
regi

.PP
.RS

.nf
[--cwd|-C]=[value]
[--member|-m]=[value]
[--offline]
[--quiet|-q]
[--verbose|-v]

.fi
.RE

.PP
\fBUsage\fP:

.PP
.RS

.nf
regi [flags] <command> [args...]

.fi
.RE


.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--cwd, -C\fP="": Change working directory before executing

.PP
\fB--member, -m\fP="": Target a specific workspace member (can be repeated)

.PP
\fB--offline\fP: Disable all network calls and fail if dependencies are not cached

.PP
\fB--quiet, -q\fP: Suppress informational output and emit only errors

.PP
\fB--verbose, -v\fP: Print detailed diagnostics and progress to stderr


.SH COMMANDS
.SH init
.PP
Initialize a new catalog or workspace

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi init [flags] [dir]

.RE

.PP
\fB--collection\fP="": Name of the initial collection to create (default: "items")

.PP
\fB--name\fP="": Catalog namespace (defaults to directory base name)

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP: Initialize a workspace root instead of a catalog

.SH check, c, validate
.PP
Validate schemas, paths, and lockfile integrity

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi check [flags]

.RE

.SH clean
.PP
Clear local download and build cache

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi clean

.RE

.SH list, ls
.PP
List entities across collections

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi list [flags] [collection]

.RE

.PP
\fB--all, -a\fP: Include entities imported from declared dependencies

.PP
\fB--json\fP: Output entities as newline-delimited JSON objects

.PP
\fB--null, -z\fP: Delimit records with ASCII NUL characters for scripts

.SH resolve
.PP
Print the filesystem path of a manifest

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi resolve  

.RE

.SH show
.PP
Stream a manifest or companion file to stdout

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi show   [path]

.RE

.SH add
.PP
Add a remote dependency to regi.toml and lock it

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi add 

.RE

.SH remove, rm
.PP
Remove a dependency from regi.toml and lockfile

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi remove 

.RE

.SH update
.PP
Update dependencies in regi.lock to latest revisions

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi update [flags] [name...]

.RE

.PP
\fB--force\fP: Allow updating when a remote tag has moved to a new commit

.SH vendor
.PP
Vendor dependencies into .regi/vendor for offline use

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi vendor [flags]

.RE

.PP
\fB--skip-blobs\fP: Skip downloading large blob payloads when vendoring

.SH pack
.PP
Build a deterministic PAX tar archive of the catalog

.PP
.RS

.PP
regi pack [flags]

.RE

.PP
\fB--output, -o\fP="": Write tar archive to file instead of stdout
